# Kernel parameters, one per line, added to GRUB's default cmdline.
#
# Framework's own Linux notes for the Ryzen AI 300 boards (FrameworkComputer/
# linux-docs, framework13/Ryzen-AI-300-Series.md) give this for "system lag or
# freezing". It turns off Panel Self Refresh and Panel Replay in amdgpu's display
# core, at some cost in idle power. No kernel or BIOS version is stated as fixing
# it. Drop it here once one is, and confirm on the machine that lag is gone.
amdgpu.dcdebugmask=0x610
